<description>&lt;p&gt;US intelligence support is now being used to target militants in Nigeria ahead of the 2027 election, and President Tinubu says four of eight identified top terrorist leaders have been killed or arrested. The Nigerian army reports eight terrorists killed and the rescue of 125 kidnapping victims, while bandits killed two abducted victims in Niger State despite a six-million-naira ransom. Mali has received Mi-24 and Mi-8 helicopters and an Il-76 transport, and 300 Russian mercenaries, likely Wagner and Africa Corps, were killed there. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOcXdLN3dvYlMwVUpIOF80bEVmVXdtTXMyRTFsMlRZNXk3U1BTZ3NzREtJMXhWcnNZTkNvZ3I3eVBZS0d4anFtSDZqaDFJMEQ4Mm83X25Fc3gzcF92RFdndTNxR3RRWWIweDJUajdMWUotVUx3a2FURW0yS0t4SXY0SFE2bHlBWC1naG9PX1phODVfbkFOcjd6UncxTVhYSTJUdnNSSUwyeXVqMm1Lekx0MU02MFQ3ZkJ5S0VISWV5UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE5aYVVWSTk0RXd2QjlOdU1TcjdxWkUyMXppcW1ES2tIS09EUTRkM1BzR1JGOVJKWVFCZXFJbmJoWWZhUDM0TWYteUlDWWxCbWIycTMzemRubTF4TjFWUmpKVS1UM2RFVW9SWWpybXQ4S2FvcTBs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa Defense Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE9lcjJkSkFFaFlIWXZlU1FCMW9Mb2lwQjl1M01OVEtWdThDbGhKUUNwNHZlbHRHRTVfS0gyX2doZ0pEWGdRMXhCaG5YOVplRFFRaUF2MnVUSXpxci1nWlVJVFZrbnRKZ0oy?oc=5&quot;&gt;Envanter Medya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPTzJ5eVR4NWJ5ZDlqVU4zZ3FjaUtvSHRpU3VuN3JKaC1kczltc2VPT2M3UVBnQnpaRmh3aWdKTkhuUWNWWG9uV1lvMGxicEw0bXZLVmxoMElSV0pJR0M3R0hFSFFCcW5EY1JPNG1nMF9RN2VtUzBhQUkzQ2wtX0o3YVdpLWVMSXpjSFRrRmJxbW5QZWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Il Sole 24 ORE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNRm0